    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOMEPAGE</strong> is a horror anomaly finder where you are contracted to observe websites and report errors and changes. But there is more to your clients than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given access to an interactive desktop software and receive requests from clients experiencing cyber attacks. Navigate the websites to locate anything out of place and use the reporting system to fix problems before the site becomes too compromised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore websites, emails and the desktop as you slowly uncover the truth behind the hacker and their motivation behind the attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529660/extras/3998209a1952406fa16fa5f5d01f852e.poster.avif?t=1749265493\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529660/extras/3998209a1952406fa16fa5f5d01f852e.webm?t=1749265493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529660/extras/3998209a1952406fa16fa5f5d01f852e.mp4?t=1749265493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple websites to explore filled with hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over two hundred unique errors on every website.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster reports improves a website's security and leads to a quicker victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive desktop system with emails, folders and files.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery elements to be uncovered about your contractors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529660/extras/13b2f7a430fb4cedf4f4595ca65a8c55.poster.avif?t=1749265493\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529660/extras/13b2f7a430fb4cedf4f4595ca65a8c55.webm?t=1749265493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529660/extras/13b2f7a430fb4cedf4f4595ca65a8c55.mp4?t=1749265493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
